# PDFs (research papers) are NOT tracked in git and NOT in Git LFS — they're
# gitignored (see .gitignore) and live on disk only, each described by a sibling
# <name>.pdf.txt (name / description / source url) so the original can be
# re-fetched. See plans/lfs-local-migration.md.

# Shell scripts must stay LF even on Windows checkouts (a CRLF shebang/`read`
# breaks bash); Windows batch files want CRLF (labels/goto misbehave on LF).
*.sh  text eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# HTTP golden vectors are byte-exact wire fixtures (CRLF). Never normalize.
test/net/golden/http/*.http -text
